X-Lab-User-Id: {{AliceId}}

###

GET {{SecureOpsLab.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vulnerabilities/a07-identification-authentication/default-login?password={{DefaultPassword}}
Accept: application/json
X-Lab-User-Id: {{AliceId}}

###

GET {{SecureOpsLab.Api_HostAddress}}/api/vulnerabilities/a08-software-data-integrity/update?packageUrl={{UnsignedPackageUrl}}
